摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"基于Karpathy的wiki方法论搭建的插件，让你的DSH直接变身成LLM wiki，不需要Obsidian+Claudian插件，国内网络友好","id":"gh:1343695590","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-LLM-wiki-plugin","slug":"Vesna-Strivozha/DSH-LLM-wiki-plugin","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"基于Karpathy的wiki方法论搭建的插件，让你的DSH直接变身成LLM wiki，不需要Obsidian+Claudian插件，国内网络友好"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH LLM Wiki Plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> An **Obsidian-style personal knowledge base** for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"LLM Wiki turns DeepSeek Harness into a lightweight Obsidian: you drop source files in, the LLM **inc"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rementally builds and maintains a persistent, interlinked wiki**, and you then **ask questions in th"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e chat that are grounded in your knowledge base** — with page citations."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Feature | What it does |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 🗂 **One-click workspace** | Pick a directory and build the wiki skeleton (`raw/`, `wiki/`, `index."},{"id":"p8s2","text":"md`, `log.md`, `schema.md`). |\n| 📥 **Upload + confirm** | Drag or select files, review them in a con"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"firm dialog, then write to `raw/`. |\n| 🧠 **Auto-ingest** | The LLM reads `raw/` and generates/update"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"s `wiki/` pages, with a progress bar and PDF text extraction. |\n| 🕸 **Knowledge graph** | Force-dire"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"cted graph of `[[wikilinks]]` with zoom/pan and click-to-open. |\n| 🩺 **Self-check (lint)** | Reports"},{"id":"p8s6","text":" orphan pages, isolated pages, and dead links. |\n| 📖 **Read in place** | Markdown renderer plus an i"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"nline PDF viewer. |\n| 💬 **Chat-grounded Q&A;** | The `wiki_query` tool and a prompt section answer q"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"uestions with page citations. |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"For chat Q&A;, add the `wiki_query` tool row to your agent preset (see the host README below)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Packages"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Package | Role |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `packages/dsh-llm-wiki` | Host engine (the installable bundle): ingest / search / graph / lint, th"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"e `wiki_query` tool, and a prompt section. |\n| `packages/dsh-client-ui-llm-wiki` | Browser panel: fi"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"le tree, upload, knowledge graph, markdown/PDF reader. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- 中文入门教程（小白向）: `packages/dsh-client-ui-llm-wiki/README.md`\n- English: `packages/dsh-llm-wiki/README."},{"id":"p17s2","text":"md`\n- 中文: `packages/dsh-llm-wiki/README.zh.md`\n- Changelog"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"See CONTRIBUTING.md."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
